{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Evidovan\u00ed uch\u00e1dza\u010di o zamestnanie","update":"2026-05-29","note":"Zdroj \u00fadajov:\n\u00darad pr\u00e1ce, soci\u00e1lnych vec\u00ed a rodiny\n....\nPo\u010det evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o zamestnanie spolu - evidovan\u00fd uch\u00e1dza\u010d o zamestnanie je ob\u010dan, ktor\u00fd m\u00f4\u017ee pracova\u0165, chce pracova\u0165 a h\u013ead\u00e1 zamestnanie a je veden\u00fd v evidencii uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o zamestnanie pr\u00edslu\u0161n\u00e9ho \u00daradu pr\u00e1ce. (389\/2006 Z.z. Z\u00e1kon o slu\u017eb\u00e1ch zamestnanosti a o zmene a doplnen\u00ed niektor\u00fdch z\u00e1konov).\nPo\u010det evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010diek o zamestnanie - z po\u010dtu evidovan\u00fdch uch\u00e1dza\u010dov o zamestnanie sa uved\u00fa \u017eeny. Nepatria sem \u017eeny na materskej dovolenke do 3 rokov veku die\u0165a\u0165a. (389\/2006 Z.z. Z\u00e1kon o slu\u017eb\u00e1ch zamestnanosti a o zmene a doplnen\u00ed niektor\u00fdch z\u00e1konov).\n","href":"http:\/\/datacube.statistics.sk\/#!\/view\/sk\/VBD_SK_WIN\/pr5001rr\/v_pr5001rr_00_00_00_sk","id":["nuts15","pr5001rr_rok","pr5001rr_ukaz","pr5001rr_data"],"size":[14,30,2,1],"role":{"time":["pr5001rr_rok"],"geo":["nuts15"],"metric":["pr5001rr_data"]},"dimension":{"nuts15":{"label":"nuts15","note":"0 SR + Oblasti + Kraje + Okresy + Obce","category":{"index":{"SK032":0,"SK0321":1,"SK0322":2,"SK0323":3,"SK0324":4,"SK0325":5,"SK0326":6,"SK0327":7,"SK0328":8,"SK0329":9,"SK032A":10,"SK032B":11,"SK032C":12,"SK032D":13},"label":{"SK032":"Banskobystrick\u00fd kraj","SK0321":"Okres Bansk\u00e1 Bystrica","SK0322":"Okres Bansk\u00e1 \u0160tiavnica","SK0323":"Okres Brezno","SK0324":"Okres Detva","SK0325":"Okres Krupina","SK0326":"Okres Lu\u010denec","SK0327":"Okres Polt\u00e1r","SK0328":"Okres Rev\u00faca","SK0329":"Okres Rimavsk\u00e1 Sobota","SK032A":"Okres Ve\u013ek\u00fd Krt\u00ed\u0161","SK032B":"Okres Zvolen","SK032C":"Okres \u017darnovica","SK032D":"Okres \u